# Immutable Migrations

- Never edit a migration that may have shipped or run on any database.
- Make schema changes in a new migration following the module's existing layout.
- Do not run migrations unless the user explicitly authorizes them.
- Follow `CLAUDE.md` Rule 8 and `.cursor/skills/laravel-best-practices/rules/migrations.md`.
